{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ca6b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ceca-cad7-7401-b120-5d187a59f4b1"},"sequence":912,"recorded_at":1780531400001819,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0cece-89e2-7be2-b31f-d7bb37454ee7"},"task_id":"01a0cece-89e2-7be2-b31f-d7bb37454ee7","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0cece-89e2-7be2-b31f-d7bb37454ee7","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-32ypr2/TASK-260830-32ypr2_conformance-matrix.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-32ypr2 Conformance Matrix (rev5) — test-unknown-encrypted-and-incomplete-events\n2|\n3|Authority: `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md`, Sections 7.8, 10.2, 13.14.1.\n4|Production entry for every row: `Normalize` (`internal/cloneproject/normalize.go:97`).\n5|Every proof builds an on-disk fixture provider store, runs the real\n6|`clonesnap.Capture` entry (`internal/clonesnap/capture.go`), then `Normalize`\n7|over the sealed manifests and installed blobs. No row drives hand-written\n8|Canonical Events or calls an unexported helper directly (verified: no test\n9|references `dispatchRecord`, `dispatchProtected`, `resolveToolCalls`,\n10|`deriveLiveSurface`, `foldInstructions`, `foldUsage`, `contentBlockForText`,\n11|`installOverflow`, `parseNativeLine`, `collectMembers`, `splitRecordLines`,\n12|`strictMembers`, `bodyUint53`, `decodeBodyObject`, `bodyString`, or\n13|`checkActorSelector`).\n14|\n15|## A. AC coverage: 47 of 47 rows driven and measured\n16|\n17|One row per behavior the brief's four invariants name plus the\n18|rework-mandated strict-framing, value-model, alias-axis, and gate\n19|rows. \"Narrowing\" names the harness row(s) in\n20|`internal/cloneproject/testdata/mutant_harness.py` that redden the\n21|row's killer(s); every narrowing admits exactly one member of the\n22|class its gate must reject. \"(killer)\" marks the plant whose\n23|committed killer is the row's test; other entries name the shared\n24|gate the plant narrows. Battery: 80 narrowings + 5 labelled rows\n25|KILLED + control SURVIVED, executed twice, exit 0 both runs, one\n26|raw log per plant per run under `mutants/run1/` + `mutants/run2/`\n27|in the producer evidence archive. The sibling `internal/clonebundle`\n28|battery (76 rows incl. the 9 new far-edge narrowings) runs twice\n29|with per-plant logs under `mutants/sibling-clonebundle-run1/` +\n30|`mutants/sibling-clonebundle-run2/`.\n31|\n32|| # | AC behavior | Driving test(s) → call site | Narrowing(s) |\n33||---|---|---|---|\n34|| 1 | Wholly unknown native type → `opaque_event`, `opaque` visibility, `unknown_native_event` reason, identity kept | `TestNormalizeUnknownRecordBecomesOpaqueEvent` → `Normalize` → `dispatchRecord` default arm | `N-unknown-kind-wholly` (killer: admits exactly `frobnicate` into `user_message`) |\n35|| 2 | Almost-known record (right envelope, unknown inner type) never coerced into a neighbouring kind | `TestNormalizeAlmostKnownRecordBecomesOpaqueEvent` → same arm | `N-unknown-kind` (killer: admits exactly `message/smoke` into `user_message`) |\n36|| 3 | Unknown-class member → whole-member `opaque_event` (offset 0, full length, null native IDs) | `TestNormalizeUnknownMemberBecomesWholeMemberOpaque` → `Normalize` → `collectMembers` | `N-unknown-member` (killer: admits exactly `store/mystery` into JSONL parsing) |\n37|| 4 | Evidence ranges resolve to the exact captured bytes at every offset (manifest + descriptor linkage, in range, offsets asserted past 0) | `TestNormalizeMultiRecordRefsResolveAtAssertedOffsets` (every event's `RawRefs[0]` resolves to its own line; offsets `0`, `len(l1)+1`, `len(l1)+len(l2)+2` asserted