{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cae3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ceca-cad7-7401-b120-5d187a59f4b1"},"sequence":972,"recorded_at":1780531400001939,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0cecf-eb33-75f2-817d-742f9cace5fa"},"task_id":"01a0cecf-eb33-75f2-817d-742f9cace5fa","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0cecf-eb33-75f2-817d-742f9cace5fa","chunk":"Read text file `internal/clonebundle/doc.go`.\n1|package clonebundle\n2|\n3|// This package implements the Section 13.14.1 clone capture contracts:\n4|// Clone Raw Object Manifest 1.0.0, Clone Capture Manifest 1.0.0 (with\n5|// Capture Items, Capture Source Basis, and Capture Boundary), Canonical\n6|// Session 1.0.0, Canonical Event 1.0.0 (with Source Evidence and raw\n7|// references), the NativeIdentity and WorkspaceBinding identities, raw\n8|// evidence descriptor agreement over Section 10.2 Blob Descriptors,\n9|// reverse-DNS extension keys, and immutable source generations.\n10|//\n11|// Authority: relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec@v0.7.0, Sections\n12|// 7.8, 10.2, and 13.14.1 (internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md; the\n13|// pinned sections are byte-identical to v0.6.0).\n14|//\n15|// Every Decode entry validates a closed shape: exact members, bounded\n16|// scalars, closed vocabularies, sorted-unique order, and self-digest\n17|// agreement. Every Build entry constructs the same bytes\n18|// deterministically: identical inputs produce byte-identical outputs,\n19|// and every Build output decodes clean. Refusals name the offending\n20|// member and never admit a partial object.\n21|//\n22|// Reuse, not fork: Environment Tuples decode through\n23|// sessadapter.DecodeTuple, Blob Descriptors verify through\n24|// canonicaljson.CalculateObjectIdentity plus a local claim comparison\n25|// (never the attesting entry, per the provhost no-attestation bound),\n26|// extension keys admit through\n27|// environ.CheckExtensions, and blob bytes install through\n28|// localstore.ObjectStore.PutBlob. The canonicaljson closed-shape\n29|// registry keeps its rejectUnsupportedImmutableObjectShape rows for\n30|// these schemas (that table's census pins every row, so replacing\n31|// them would fork ownership); this package is the validating owner\n32|// and says so here and in TRACEABILITY.md.\n33|//\n34|// Stated bounds (sibling scope, not waived): per-kind Canonical Event\n35|// payload fact registries beyond the Section 13.14.1 envelope rules\n36|// enforced here (which facts a kind may carry; the Section 1.6 value\n37|// model on every payload member is enforced here);\n38|// maximal_safe projection gating past the raw_complete=false\n39|// derivation; target-branch (G2) admission beyond\n40|// RefuseUnstableForTarget; capture-plan/capture/normalize adapter\n41|// operation wiring (Section 7.8 bodies stay owned by sessadapter).\n42|// This package performs no durable write itself: blob installation\n43|// delegates to the landed localstore no-replace discipline, and the\n44|// crash/idempotency evidence for that path is cited in\n45|// TRACEABILITY.md.","final_result":true}}}
