fault.Member}\n+\t}\n+\treturn members, nil\n+}''',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestReportFraming\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Shared gate: admits exactly a duplicate source_class member past the row frame into a lenient decode; the report duplicate still refuses.\",\n+    ),\n+]\n","final_result":true}}}
