{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dd45","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ceca-cad7-7401-b120-5d187a59f4b1"},"sequence":3325,"recorded_at":1780531400006645,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f679b6f1-9902-47f8-8dc1-d6bbf0923c83"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0cee8-0452-7081-988a-a67fa5f399d4"},"task_id":"01a0cee8-0452-7081-988a-a67fa5f399d4","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0cee8-0452-7081-988a-a67fa5f399d4","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 110-124\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 54 narrowing rows plus the\n-harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED control. Every narrowing weakens\n-one gate to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject,\n-and every killer drives a production entry. Shared gates (one\n-implementation, two call sites: the vocabulary predicates, the\n-reason/canonical/order helpers, the counts derivation) carry one\n-plant each with a dual-entry killer, exactly like the prior leaf's\n-`N-strict-*` rows. `N-disposition-route` and `N-reason-core-route`\n-are the token-preserving attacks: the searched-for token still\n-matches while the decision changes, and the killers execute the\n-behavioral oracle suites through both entries. `N-rowcount-max` is\n-the factored-bound narrowing (the exact upper edge is pinned at the\n-factored gate; entry reachability by `TestRowCountEdges`). The\n-battery runs twice with one raw log per plant per run carrying the\n-subprocess exit.\n+`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 62 narrowing rows plus the\n+harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED control. Every narrowing weakens\n+one gate to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject,\n+and every killer drives a production entry. Shared gates (one\n+implementation, two call sites: the vocabulary predicates, the\n+reason/canonical/order/count helpers, the breakdown sums, the\n+row-count gate, the strict frame) carry one plant each with a\n+dual-entry killer, exactly like the prior leaf's `N-strict-*` rows;\n+rules implemented twice (build + decode) carry one plant per side.\n+`N-disposition-route` and `N-reason-core-route` are the\n+token-preserving attacks: the searched-for token still matches\n+while the decision changes, and the killers execute the behavioral\n+oracle suites through both entries. `N-rowcount-max` and\n+`N-rowcount-min` are the factored-bound narrowings (the exact edges\n+are pinned at the factored gate; entry reachability by\n+`TestRowCountEdges`). `N-record-synth-canonical` is labelled\n+single-member class. The battery runs twice with one raw log per\n+plant per run carrying the subprocess exit.\n","final_result":true}}}
